      "placement_scope": "PAGE_BAND",
      "reading_order": 2,
      "source_script_hash": "94b3a7520beb8b1681dccf8743da68c09cdb9209645e11fd198eb6c774b38a4a",
      "speaker_id": "narrator",
      "text": "The words changed the shape of the contest.\n\nMadhu and Kaitabha had offered the boon jointly. Vishnu had not asked them for land, treasure or long life. He had asked for the one outcome their pride had not expected to grant: their own defeat at his hands."
    }
